":{"description":"A perfect introduction to classical music for kids (and adults) of all ages. Da-da-da-DAAAAH, Da-da-da-DAAAAH: listen to track 7 and see if you recognise that music! It's one of the most famous pieces of classical music ever written. There are some animals here, too - an elephant and a swan. And right at the end, guess which boy wizard joins the party... Come and join it too!\nIncludes:\nVivaldi The Four Seasons - Beethoven Symphony No. 5\nGrieg Peer Gynt - Saint-Saens The Carnival of the Animals\nDukas The Sorcerer's Apprentice - Prokofiev Peter and the Wolf\nMozart The Magic Flute - Rossini William Tell ...and many more!","category":"music","restricted":true,"author":"Various","previewAudio":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0051/8845/2401/files/my-first-classical-music-album.mp3","audioPreviewUrl":"https://audio-previews-media.api.yotoplay.com/audio-previews/c2ac1595563a9857899a22457c1b13c0c963f359d4e88e8fb99f3d76def24d80/7yw8G6SSSXulTptSnCAPD63sF9DrTz39Ar98kJZJoVw.mp3","abridged":false,"copyright":"℗ © 2011 Naxos","maxAge":14,"minAge":0,"cover":{"imageL":"https://card-content.yotoplay.com/yoto/pub/JonNb8ZcnRRciRa8Szm4fFMdu4dl0N_hWFOCq0-e69s"},"status":{"name":"live","updatedAt":"2020-11-20T09:39:44.495Z"},"languages":["en"],"media":{"duration":5297,"fileSize":106262973,"hasStreams":false},"authors":["Various"],"copyrights":["℗ © 2011 Naxos"],"musicTypes":["classical-music"],"narrators":["Various"]},"slug":"my-first-classical-music-album","title":"My First Classical Music Album","updatedAt":"2026-01-19T14:34:41.826Z","userId":"yoto","sortkey":"my-first-classical-music-album","clubAvailability":[],"scanToAdd":false},"ownership":{"canAccess":true,"userHasRole":false,"cardIsFree":false,"cardIsMadeByUser":false,"cardIsInFamilyLibrary":false,"cardIsCreatedByFamily":false,"isAccessibleUsingSubscription":false,"isAccessibleAsPhysicalPlay":false,"isShareLink":false,"isReconditionCard":false,"inCardPacks":false,"previewAccessOnly":true}}